# Deny-by-default build context. Only files copied by Dockerfile are sent to
# the builder; this also excludes .env files, credentials, keys, certificates,
# backups and future local files without relying on their names.
*
!Dockerfile
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!src/
!src/**
!web/
!web/**
!upstream/
!upstream/**
!UPSTREAM_VERSION
